{"availability":"available","full":"jayschellenberg/winnipeg-opendata-parcelsearch","name":"winnipeg-opendata-parcelsearch","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-15T00:31:03Z","updated":"2026-10-10T18:27:30Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://winnipeg-opendata-parcelsearch.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://winnipeg-opendata-parcelsearch.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T20:52:41.198Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T20:52:41.198Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T20:52:41.198Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:00.128Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T20:52:41.198Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A free, client-only parcel-research tool for City of Winnipeg properties, built for commercial-appraisal workflows.","Search parcels by legal description (Lot / Block / Plan) or by roll number, civic address, zoning, and dwelling-unit count; see survey lots and assessment parcels together on a MapLibre map (street, satellite, or 7.5 cm City aerial basemaps); toggle 15 reference overlays (citywide zoning, traffic volumes, transit, OurWinnipeg policy areas, contaminated sites, neighbourhoods, parcel dimensions); browse historical as-of-date parcels with inferred lineage and size-change highlighting; analyse comparable sales from SABRE exports (drop a file, paste a block, or connect a folder as a local sales…","There is no server, database, or login. The browser queries the City of Winnipeg Open Data Socrata API live on every search; heavier citywide overlays are cached in IndexedDB. Historical snapshots stream as one whole-city PMTiles archive per date from R2 (built by r/buildhistoricaltiles.R from the companion wpg-parcel-history data repo, which still serves the lineage and as-of zoning files via CDN)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/j